# ffmpeg.exe and ffprobe.exe (an LGPL build from https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds, win64-lgpl)
# are over GitHub's 100 MB a file, so they're in git zipped: ffmpeg.zip and ffprobe.zip here.
# "Build Octave.bat" (Tools/builder.py) unpacks them into bin/, where Octave looks for them; or
# unzip both into bin/ yourself, or set OCTAVE_FFMPEG / OCTAVE_FFPROBE.
bin/
